{"id": "17-3316-2-9", "zh": "539. 要构成动词形式时，名词之后加 ṇaya，并且（称为使役）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3317-2-26", "zh": "当要构成动词形式时，或者要表达“taṃ karoti（做那个）”“tena atikkamati（以那个越过）”等意思时，名词之后加 ṇaya 词缀，它也称为使役（kārita）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3317-27-59", "zh": "删去 ṇ，再删去格尾、元音等之后，接上动词语尾：daḷhayati vīriyaṃ（使精进坚固）；同样有 pamāṇayati（衡量）、amissayati（不混杂）；又如以象越过，是 atihatthayati；在琵琶旁伴唱，是 upavīṇayati；夜晚变得清净，是 visuddhayati；问候安好，是 kusalayati，等等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3318-2-12", "zh": "540. 表示使因义时，在动词词根之后加 ṇe、ṇaya、ṇāpe、ṇāpaya，称为使役。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3319-2-18", "zh": "当要表达使因义时，一切动词词根之后都可以接 ṇe、ṇaya、ṇāpe、ṇāpaya 这些词缀，它们也称为使役。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3319-19-45", "zh": "使因本身就是意义，所以称为使因义（hetvattha）。依“使别人去做的就是使因”而得到使因之名的，是推动单纯作者的使因作者；就意义来说，这里所说的使因，是指派遣、请求等推动者的作为。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3320-2-4", "zh": "这里——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3321-2-10", "zh": "以 u、ū 结尾的词根只加 ṇe、ṇaya，以 ā 结尾的可加后两个；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3322-2-8", "zh": "其余的加四个或两个，因为“vā”一词延续下来。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3323-2-9", "zh": "不及物的词根，在使役时就成为及物的；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3324-2-8", "zh": "及物的成为带双宾语的，带双宾语的则成为带三宾语的。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3325-2-8", "zh": "所以使役动词可以用于主动态和被动态；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3326-2-9", "zh": "不用于无人称态；在使役中，单纯作者称为宾语。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3327-2-8", "zh": "nī 等词根的主要宾语、duh 等词根的次要宾语，", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-3328-2-7", "zh": "以及使役中的单纯作者，都是被动动词所表达的宾语。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "17-3329-2-68", "zh": "这里，有某人存在，另一个人对他这样说：“bhavāhi bhavāhi（你要成为，你要成为）”；或者推动正在成为、能够成为的人；或者说推动他去成为——在这个意义上，依本条加 ṇe、ṇaya 词缀，并称为使役；依“已表达意义的不再使用”，不用分析句；依“使役的 ṇ 删去”，删去 ṇ；依“非复辅音结尾的词根在使役时强化”，ū 音强化为 o 音。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3330-2-15", "zh": "“o、e”以及“词根”一词延续下来。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3331-2-8", "zh": "541. 在使役时，它们变为 āva、āya。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3332-2-13", "zh": "在使役词缀之后，作为词根末尾的 o、e 两音分别替换为 āva、āya。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3332-14-42", "zh": "依“Te āvāyā”这一分条，jhe 等词根即使不在使役时也有这种替换；于是 o 音替换为 āva，删去元音等，再依“在词根与词缀之后接语尾”加上 ti 等语尾。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-3333-2-11", "zh": "他修习定：bhāveti、bhāvayati、bhāventi、bhāvayanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3333-12-19", "zh": "bhāvesi、bhāvayasi、bhāvetha、bhāvayatha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3333-20-27", "zh": "bhāvemi、bhāvayāmi、bhāvema、bhāvayāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3333-28-31", "zh": "bhāvayate、bhāvayante。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3334-2-13", "zh": "在被动态中，加为自言语尾、ya 词缀和 ī 音增音，并删去元音等：定被他修习，bhāvīyate、bhāvīyante。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3334-14-17", "zh": "bhāvīyati、bhāvīyanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3335-2-10", "zh": "同样：bhāvetu、bhāvayatu、bhāventu、bhāvayantu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3335-11-21", "zh": "bhāvehi、bhāvaya、bhāvayāhi、bhāvetha、bhāvayatha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3335-22-29", "zh": "bhāvemi、bhāvayāmi、bhāvema、bhāvayāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3335-30-33", "zh": "bhāvayataṃ、bhāvayantaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3336-2-8", "zh": "被动态：bhāvīyataṃ、bhāvīyatu、bhāvīyantu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3337-2-11", "zh": "bhāveyya、bhāvaye、bhāvayeyya、bhāveyyuṃ、bhāvayeyyuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3337-12-19", "zh": "bhāveyyāsi、bhāvayeyyāsi、bhāveyyātha、bhāvayeyyātha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3337-20-27", "zh": "bhāveyyāmi、bhāvayeyyāmi、bhāveyyāma、bhāvayeyyāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3337-28-35", "zh": "bhāvetha、bhāvayetha、bhāveraṃ、bhāvayeraṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3338-2-6", "zh": "被动态：bhāvīyeyya、bhāvīyeyyuṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3339-2-13", "zh": "在过去时（ajjatanī）中，依“sattamajjatanimhi”这一分条，以使役词缀结尾的词根在长音之后也加 s 音增音。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-3340-2-21", "zh": "abhāvesi、bhāvesi、abhāvayi、bhāvayi、abhāvesuṃ、bhāvesuṃ、abhāvayiṃsu、bhāvayiṃsu、abhāvayuṃ、bhāvayuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3340-22-29", "zh": "abhāvesi、abhāvayasi、abhāvittha、abhāvayittha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3340-30-41", "zh": "abhāvesiṃ、bhāvesiṃ、abhāvayiṃ、bhāvayiṃ、abhāvimha、abhāvayimha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3341-2-6", "zh": "被动态：abhāvīyittha、abhāvīyi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3342-2-9", "zh": "bhāvessati、bhāvayissati、bhāvessanti、bhāvayissanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3342-10-17", "zh": "bhāvessasi、bhāvayissasi、bhāvissatha、bhāvayissatha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3342-18-25", "zh": "bhāvessāmi、bhāvayissāmi、bhāvessāma、bhāvayissāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3343-2-6", "zh": "被动态：bhāvīyissate、bhāvīyissante。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3343-7-10", "zh": "bhāvīyissati、bhāvīyissanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3344-2-9", "zh": "abhāvissa、abhāvayissa、abhāvissaṃsu、abhāvayissaṃsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3344-10-15", "zh": "被动态：abhāvīyissatha、abhāvīyissa，等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3345-2-40", "zh": "同样，有某人在煮，另一个人对他这样说：“pacāhi pacāhi（你煮吧，你煮吧）”；或者推动正在煮的人；或者说推动他去煮——在这个意义上，按前面说的方式加 ṇe、ṇaya 等词缀，a 音强化为 ā 音，其余的可以类推。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3346-2-8", "zh": "他让天授煮饭：pāceti、pācenti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3346-9-12", "zh": "pācesi、pācetha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3346-13-16", "zh": "pācemi、pācema。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3346-17-20", "zh": "pācayati、pācayanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3346-21-24", "zh": "pācayasi、pācayatha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3346-25-28", "zh": "pācayāmi、pācayāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3346-29-39", "zh": "而在 ṇāpe、ṇāpaya 中：那个人让这个人煮饭，pācāpeti、pācāpenti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3346-40-43", "zh": "pācāpayati、pācāpayanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3347-2-13", "zh": "被动态：他被那人使去煮饭，pācīyati、pācayīyati、pācāpīyati、pācāpayīyati。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3348-2-10", "zh": "同样：pācetu、pācayatu、pācāpetu、pācāpayatu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3348-11-26", "zh": "pācīyataṃ、pācīyatu、pācayīyataṃ、pācayīyatu、pācāpīyataṃ、pācāpīyatu、pācāpayīyataṃ、pācāpayīyatu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3348-27-34", "zh": "pāceyya、pācayeyya、pācāpeyya、pācāpayeyya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3348-35-38", "zh": "pācīyeyya、pācīyeyyuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3348-39-46", "zh": "apācesi、apācayi、apācāpesi、apācāpayi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3348-47-54", "zh": "pācessati、pācayissati、pācāpessati、pācāpayissati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3348-55-63", "zh": "apācissa、apācayissa、apācāpissa、apācāpayissa，等等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3349-2-14", "zh": "推动正在去的人，或者说推动他去——在这个意义上，加 ṇe、ṇaya 等词缀，当应该强化时——", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3350-2-11", "zh": "“非复辅音结尾的词根在使役时强化”延续下来。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3351-2-7", "zh": "542. ghaṭ 等词根可选。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3352-2-19", "zh": "ghaṭ 等非复辅音结尾的词根，在使役时可以强化；这里由于用了“vā”一词，（有的）不强化；这个 vā 字表示有定限的选择。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "17-3353-2-14", "zh": "他让那个人去村子：gameti、gamayati、gacchāpeti、gacchāpayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3353-15-26", "zh": "被动态：那人被他使往村子，gamīyati、gamayīyati、gacchāpīyati、gacchāpayīyati，等等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3353-27-29", "zh": "各处都要这样套用。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3353-30-32", "zh": "下面也是这样。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3354-2-20", "zh": "ghaṭa 是努力的意思：推动正在努力的人，是 ghaṭeti；依“ghaṭ 等词根可选”而不强化；还有 ghaṭayati、ghaṭāpeti、ghaṭāpayati。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3355-2-9", "zh": "“在使役时”延续下来。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3356-2-8", "zh": "543. guh、dus 变为长音。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3357-2-12", "zh": "guh、dus 这两个词根的元音，在后接使役词缀时变为长音；这是强化规则的例外。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3358-2-10", "zh": "guha 是隐藏的意思：推动别人去隐藏，是 gūhayati、gūhayanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3358-11-20", "zh": "dusa 是不喜的意思：推动正在厌恶的人，是 dūsayati、dūsayanti，等等。", "confidence": 75}
